    { title: 'Connect Performance to Claims and Market Value', items: ['Corporate inventory and target alignment', 'Certification and sourcing claims', 'Product, customer, and commercial propositions', 'Scope 3 and inset pathways', 'Carbon and ecosystem-service market assessment', 'Low-carbon feedstock and regulatory opportunities', 'Claims governance and communication boundaries'] },
